      "claim": "No escalation limb of POL-NS-09 is engaged. The anti-farming check does not trip; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0; rider_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d and driver_profile.disputes_with_counterparty_90d are both 0, so there is no repeat pairing between these parties; no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; and the only impaired artifact (EV-ADVIS-09102-01, MISSING, weight_multiplier 0.0) carries no deciding fact, which the GPS trace supplies at full weight. The case is decidable on the record and should not be held.",
      "side": "DRIVER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-09102-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}

