der POL-NS-07 at 80 per cent of the SGD 6.00 fee — SGD 4.80, the figure published in EV-FARE-09102. The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1 (below 4) and 1 of 120 completed trips is 0.008 (below 0.08), so compensation is paid rather than withheld. Per POL-GEN-03 this makes the ruling value DRIVER_COMPENSATION, with amount_sgd carrying the same SGD 4.80, while the rider's SGD 6.00 charge is left in place; the rider's claim is not supported. No escalation limb of POL-NS-09 engages — confidence is above the 0.70 floor, no two admissible artifacts contradict each other, rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 0, both disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0, and no deciding fact rests on an impaired artifact — and no clause produces a referral. The lifetime prior_no_show_flags counters on both profiles are context only under POL-GEN-01 and were not used."
